<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38454.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38454.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.38454, versus 1.38887 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.33918   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	7.89326   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	167.875   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.850559  (0.505474)</p>
