<p> Italian Lire	2327.01   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	   n/a     (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.63132   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner    n/a     (6.59386)</p>
